{"slug":"Behaviour","name":"Behaviour","namespace":"Ara","kind":"class","declaration":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> abstract</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> class</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Behaviour</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>A per-entity object with Unity-like ergonomics that holds no authoritative state. Declare <code>sealed partial class Door : Behaviour</code> with <code>[Property] public partial float OpenAngle { get; set; }</code>: the generator backs each property with a column of the generated <code>Door</code> data component, so the value is saved, replicated and survives reload. Other instance fields must be <a href=\"/docs/scripting/TransientAttribute\"><code>TransientAttribute</code></a> caches (ARA0101).</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Lifecycle: <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#onspawn\"><code>OnSpawn</code></a> once when the entity gains the behaviour, <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#ontick\"><code>OnTick</code></a> every fixed tick, <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#onframe\"><code>OnFrame</code></a> every presented frame, <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#onreload\"><code>OnReload</code></a> instead of <code>OnSpawn</code> on objects recreated by a module reload. Behaviours of one type run serially in a deterministic order, with exclusive world access, so <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#get\"><code>Get</code></a> may touch any component.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"Entity","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Entity Entity { get; }</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>The entity this behaviour belongs to.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"property","name":"Commands","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Commands Commands { get; }</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Structural changes, applied after this phase.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"Rng","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Rng</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Rng;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Deterministic random numbers, reseeded for every callback from the tick, the type and the entity.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"method","name":"OnSpawn","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> virtual</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> OnSpawn</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">();</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Called once, the first tick the entity has this behaviour.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"method","name":"OnTick","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> virtual</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> OnTick</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Tick</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> tick);</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Called every fixed simulation tick.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[{"name":"tick"}]},{"kind":"method","name":"OnFrame","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> virtual</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> OnFrame</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Frame</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> frame);</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Called every presented frame (presentation only; never change simulation state here).</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[{"name":"frame"}]},{"kind":"method","name":"OnReload","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">protected</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> virtual</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> OnReload</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">();</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Called instead of <a href=\"/docs/scripting/Behaviour#onspawn\"><code>OnSpawn</code></a> on an object recreated by a module reload; rebuild transient caches here.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"method","name":"Get","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><sp